                <pb facs="0742" n="654" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg654"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Russell to Mr. Hay.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Panama</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1904-05-18"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">May 18,
                    1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Your cable has been communicated to the Panama Government and withdrawal of their
                    request energetically urged. Panama unwilling to authorize payment to Morgan and
                    maintain that it has a right to have payment made to the commission which was
                    appointed as a result of your cable of April 30, complying with its request to
                    pay one million to Morgan and hold balance for their account.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Russell.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
